WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.650
[Instrumental music] Clemson’s original campus dashboard.

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:12.000
The new dashboard lets you search all campus services
or choose one of seven sections in the sidebar.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.650
Student Self-Service originally groups links in a long list.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:23.000
Find a service by name or category,
or jump straight to classes, registration, or grades.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.650
Clemson’s original registration home.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:34.000
The redesigned cards link to Browse Classes,
Plan Ahead, and View Registration Information.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.650
The original Browse Classes search form.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:46.000
Search by course code, title, or CRN.
Compare meeting times and open seats.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.500
Open a section to see ratings and difficulty
from a matching Clemson profile on Rate My Professors.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:59.000
Clemson grade distributions show historical percentages.
Choose a report to see an individual section.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.200
Add lectures, labs, and weekend meetings
to a temporary weekly schedule.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:09.000
An overlapping section triggers a time conflict.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Find iROAR Premium in the Chrome Web Store. [Music fades]
